  "Offline regeneration: {0} · SLOPE |Δ| {n0} (tol {n1}) · ROUGH |Δ| {n2} (tol {n3}) · T-RANGE |Δ| {n4} (tol {n5}) · THERM |Δ| {n6} (tol {n7})": "Offline-Neuerzeugung: {0} · SLOPE |Δ| {n0} (Tol. {n1}) · ROUGH |Δ| {n2} (Tol. {n3}) · T-RANGE |Δ| {n4} (Tol. {n5}) · THERM |Δ| {n6} (Tol. {n7})",
